                    {
                        "sense_id": "7ad33f4e-3248-3a51-8551-ba6af54c06f0",
                        "entry_id": "83f4bf52-17ce-3e63-84c1-92948fb201dc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to contrive (to), to manage (to)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6acaf80a-a187-421e-8e15-a20e79866e0b",
                                "sense_id": "7ad33f4e-3248-3a51-8551-ba6af54c06f0",
                                "text": "Грым уме́л спать, не наруша́я социа́льных прили́чий, и да́же ухитря́лся отмеча́ть сквозь сон знако́мые узо́ры зву́ков.",
                                "translation": "Grim knew how to doze off without offending against the social proprieties, and he even managed to register the familiar patterns of sounds through his sleep.",
                                "english": "Grim knew how to doze off without offending against the social proprieties, and he even managed to register the familiar patterns of sounds through his sleep."
                            }
                        ]
